---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Live Market Analyzer | Dilanjan DK"
  description="A planned project for live market data analysis, signals, and interpretable visual summaries."
>
  <header class="py-16 px-4 text-center bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-background">
    <p class="eyebrow">Planned project</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Live Market Analyzer</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">A future workspace for turning live market data into clear, testable insight.</p>
    <a href="/projects/" class="inline-block mt-4 text-sm text-primary hover:underline">&larr; Back to Projects</a>
  </header>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">
    <img src="/assets/images/projects/neuroimaging-system.jpg" alt="Abstract data-stream visual representing a future live market analytics project" class="w-full aspect-video object-cover rounded-[1.25rem] border border-border" width="1024" height="576" loading="eager" />
    <section class="rounded-[1.25rem] border border-border bg-card p-6 md:p-8">
      <p class="section-kicker">Coming next</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">A placeholder for a future build.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed">This project is reserved for a live market-analysis tool. The planned direction is to combine reliable data ingestion, transparent indicators, backtesting, and readable visualizations in one practical research workspace.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed">Implementation details will be added as the project develops. The goal is to make the analysis inspectable and educational—not to present financial advice or guaranteed predictions.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
